  :MitigateDeleteNoticeC1 :suggestionText "Add odrl:constraint with tosl:noticeDays >= 14 to :PermDeleteAccount." .
  :MitigateDeleteInformC1 a dpv:RiskMitigationMeasure .
  :MitigateDeleteInformC1 dct:description "Add a duty to inform the consumer prior to account removal." .
  :MitigateDeleteInformC1 dpv:mitigatesRisk :DeleteAccountNoSafeguardsRiskC1 .
  :MitigateDeleteInformC1 :suggestionText "Add odrl:duty [ odrl:action odrl:inform ] to :PermDeleteAccount." .
